{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
  <meta charset='utf-8' />
  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1' />
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Aromatherapy & Practical Rituals</title>
  <meta name='description' content='A scent practice that may support calmer, clearer moments. Consults, blends, and curated kits.' />
  <link rel='stylesheet' href='assets/css/styles.css' />
</head>
<body>
  <header class='site-header'>
    <div class='wrap'>
      <div class='brand'>
        <a href='index.html' class='logo' aria-label='Home'>
          <svg width='48' height='48' viewBox='0 0 48 48' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' aria-hidden='true'>
            <circle cx='24' cy='24' r='22' fill='none' stroke='var(--accent)' stroke-width='2' />
            <path d='M12 30c6-8 12-8 18 0' stroke='var(--accent)' stroke-width='2' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <div>
          <div class='name'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div class='tag'>{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav class='main-nav'>
        <a href='index.html'>Home</a>
        <a href='services.html'>Offerings</a>
        <a href='blends.html'>Signature Blends</a>
        <a href='shop.html'>Shop</a>
        <a href='pricing.html'>Plans</a>
        <a href='about.html'>Our Story</a>
        <a href='book.html'>Schedule</a>
        <a href='contact.html' class='cta small-cta'>Reach Out</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class='hero' id='hero'>
      <div class='wrap grid-2'>
        <div class='hero-copy'>
          <h1>Thoughtful blends and short scent sessions that may support everyday balance.</h1>
          <p class='lead'>Rooted in safety and simple rituals, our consultations and preblended kits are crafted to help you notice small shifts in mood and focus.</p>
          <div class='hero-ctas'>
            <a class='btn primary' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <a class='btn ghost' href='book.html'>Book a micro-session</a>
          </div>
          <ul class='contact-list'>
            <li><strong>Call</strong> <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}'>{{PHONE}}</a></li>
            <li><strong>Email</strong> <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'>{{EMAIL}}</a></li>
            <li class='location'>Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class='hero-art'>
          <div class='pattern-wrap'>
            <svg class='bottle' viewBox='0 0 200 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' aria-hidden='true'>
              <defs>
                <linearGradient id='g1' x1='0' x2='1'>
                  <stop offset='0' stop-color='var(--accent)' stop-opacity='0.2'/>
                  <stop offset='1' stop-color='var(--accent-dark)' stop-opacity='0.05'/>
                </linearGradient>
              </defs>
              <rect x='10' y='20' rx='20' ry='20' width='180' height='160' fill='url(#g1)' />
              <circle cx='100' cy='70' r='26' fill='var(--accent)' opacity='0.08' />
              <path d='M70 140c12-10 36-10 48 0' stroke='var(--accent-dark)' stroke-width='4' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' />
            </svg>
            <img src='assets/img/pattern.svg' alt='' class='bg-pattern' aria-hidden='true' />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class='pillars' id='offerings'>
      <div class='wrap'>
        <h2>Three ways to invite scent into routine</h2>
        <div class='grid-3'>
          <article>
            <h3>Scent Consults</h3>
            <p>Short consultations that may support clearer routines and mindful moments. Safety notes and simple at-home practices included.</p>
            <a href='book.html' class='link'>Reserve a consult</a>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>Curated Kits</h3>
            <p>Thoughtfully assembled kits for evenings, focus, or refresh — ready-to-use with dilution guidance and usage ideas.</p>
            <a href='shop.html' class='link'>Explore kits</a>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>Signature Programs</h3>
            <p>Multi-session journeys designed around a goal (calm, clarity, seasonal reset) that may support steady changes over time.</p>
            <a href='pricing.html' class='link'>See plans</a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class='myth-truth'>
      <div class='wrap'>
        <h2>Myth vs. Truth</h2>
        <div class='mt-grid'>
          <div class='myth'>
            <h4>Myth</h4>
            <p>Essential oils solve medical problems overnight.</p>
          </div>
          <div class='truth'>
            <h4>Truth</h4>
            <p>Good scent practices are supportive, gentle tools that may support mood and routines when used safely and thoughtfully.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class='case-notes' aria-label='Proof Gallery'>
      <div class='wrap'>
        <h2>Stories from people who tried a simple scent practice</h2>
        <div class='proof'>
          <div class='testimonials' id='testimonials'>
            <div class='testimonial active' data-author='A. Rivera' data-badge='studio'>
              <p>"The 20-minute consult gave me a practical ritual I could actually use before work—small but steady."</p>
              <div class='meta'><span class='author'>A. Rivera</span> · <span class='role'>Client</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class='testimonial' data-author='M. Chen' data-badge='publisher'>
              <p>"I love the nightly kit. The guide helped me adapt it around a pet in the home."</p>
              <div class='meta'><span class='author'>M. Chen</span> · <span class='role'>Subscriber</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class='testimonial' data-author='S. Patel' data-badge='association'>
              <p>"Clear instructions and a helpful patch-test walkthrough made it easy to try safely."</p>
              <div class='meta'><span class='author'>S. Patel</span> · <span class='role'>Workshop Attendee</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <aside class='credibility'>
            <h3>Credibility</h3>
            <div class='badges' id='badges'>
              <button class='badge' data-tip='Local aromatherapy studio, open since 2019' data-key='studio' aria-label='Studio badge'>
                <svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' class='icon'><circle cx='12' cy='12' r='9' /></svg>
                <span class='label'>Studio</span>
              </button>
              <button class='badge' data-tip='Featured in regional lifestyle magazine' data-key='publisher' aria-label='Publisher badge'>
                <svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' class='icon'><rect x='4' y='4' width='16' height='16' rx='2' /></svg>
                <span class='label'>Featured</span>
              </button>
              <button class='badge' data-tip='Member of professional aromatherapy association' data-key='association' aria-label='Association badge'>
                <svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' class='icon'><path d='M12 4 L20 20 H4 Z' /></svg>
                <span class='label'>Member</span>
              </button>
            </div>
            <div class='badge-tip' id='badgeTip' aria-hidden='true'></div>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class='pricing' id='pricing'>
      <div class='wrap'>
        <h2>Programs and pricing</h2>
        <p class='sub'>Flexible options — choose monthly or a bundled package. Numbers animate to help comparison.</p>
        <div class='price-tool'>
          <div class='toggle'>
            <label class='switch'>
              <input type='checkbox' id='priceToggle'>
              <span class='slider'></span>
            </label>
            <span class='toggle-label'>Monthly</span>
          </div>

          <div class='plans'>
            <div class='plan'>
              <h4>Intro Session</h4>
              <div class='price' data-month='45' data-package='120'>$<span class='num' id='p1'>45</span></div>
              <p class='note'>30-minute consult, safety & home-use plan.</p>
            </div>
            <div class='plan'>
              <h4>Starter Kit</h4>
              <div class='price' data-month='18' data-package='50'>$<span class='num' id='p2'>18</span></div>
              <p class='note'>Three small blends with dilution swatches.</p>
            </div>
            <div class='plan'>
              <h4>Renew Program</h4>
              <div class='price' data-month='28' data-package='150'>$<span class='num' id='p3'>28</span></div>
              <p class='note'>Three sessions and seasonal top-ups included in package.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class='faq'>
      <div class='wrap'>
        <h2>FAQ — safety and use</h2>
        <div class='qa'>
          <div>
            <h4>Are these medical treatments?</h4>
            <p>No. Aromatic practices are supportive lifestyle tools and may support wellbeing; they are not medical treatments.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4>Do you include dilution guidance?</h4>
            <p>Yes. Every blend and kit includes recommended dilution ratios and clear patch-test steps to help reduce risk.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4>What about pets?</h4>
            <p>Certain oils can affect animals. We include pet-safety notes and alternatives — always check with your veterinarian for specific concerns.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4>Pregnancy or medical conditions?</h4>
            <p>If you are pregnant or have medical concerns, consult your healthcare provider before using essential oils. We avoid making medical claims and provide safety-forward options.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class='final-cta'>
      <div class='wrap'>
        <h2>Ready to try a short session or a curated kit?</h2>
        <p>Book an introduction or shop a ready kit. Simple guidance and patch-test instructions included.</p>
        <a class='btn primary large' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer class='site-footer'>
    <div class='wrap'>
      <div class='foot-left'>
        <div class='name'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div class='tag'>Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      </div>
      <div class='foot-right'>
        <a href='privacy.html'>Privacy</a>
        <a href='contact.html'>Contact</a>
        <div class='small'>© <span id='year'></span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src='assets/js/main.js'></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
